				<div itemprop="description">
			<p>The original <em>V8</em> juice! This uniquely satisfying blend of vegetable juice is an excellent source of Vitamins A &amp; C and helps you get 2 servings of vegetables in every delicious 8 ounce glass for your balanced lifestyle. All this for only 45 calories per serving! V8 Original 100% Vegetable Juice has no sugar added and no artificial colors or flavors.</p>
		</div>
		
